<title>BELGIUM: Belgian Deceuninck sets up Russian sales outlet.</title>
<headline>Belgian Deceuninck sets up Russian sales outlet.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deceuninck NV, a Belgian producer of PVC profiles for the building sector, has set up a distribution office in Smolensk, a town 350 kilometres west of Moscow, the group said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>It added that it planned to set up showrooms in Russia's main cities in the future.</p>
<p>Deceuninck already has units in the Czech Republic and Poland.</p>
<p>Deceuninck earned a 1996 first-half group net profit of 186 million francs.</p>
